    "detailed_description": "<strong>About the Game:</strong><br><br>Dive into the thrilling underworld of covert operations with Stealth Raider, the ultimate stealth-action adventure. As a master thief, your skills in subterfuge, agility, and cunning are your greatest assets. Navigate through intricate mazes, ancient dungeons, and high-security vaults, each filled with treasures to plunder and dangers to avoid.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li></li></ul><strong>Dynamic Stealth Mechanics:</strong> Use shadows, disguises, and your environment to remain undetected. Each level presents unique challenges that require a strategic approach to avoid traps, outsmart guards, and bypass advanced security systems.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/5ff6b4549e9df98ae0d78f95375159c8.poster.avif?t=1730468210\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/5ff6b4549e9df98ae0d78f95375159c8.webm?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/5ff6b4549e9df98ae0d78f95375159c8.mp4?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Diverse Levels: Explore a variety of stunning environments, from medieval castles and abandoned temples to modern high-tech facilities. Each level is meticulously designed with hidden paths, secret rooms, and valuable loot.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/e72aaabc8320dc45646b91a9d6f817f5.poster.avif?t=1730468210\" width=600 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/e72aaabc8320dc45646b91a9d6f817f5.webm?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/e72aaabc8320dc45646b91a9d6f817f5.mp4?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Challenging Puzzles: Engage your brain with complex puzzles that unlock new areas and treasures. Use your wits to solve ancient riddles, deactivate security systems, and open secret passages.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/718f1c98bb864d59327529754179102c.poster.avif?t=1730468210\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/718f1c98bb864d59327529754179102c.webm?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/718f1c98bb864d59327529754179102c.mp4?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Upgrade Your Gear: Collect and utilize a range of gadgets and tools to aid your heists. From lockpicks and grappling hooks to advanced cloaking devices, customize your loadout to suit your playstyle.<br><br>Non-linear Gameplay: Choose your path and play your way. Whether you prefer a methodical, quiet approach or a daring, high-risk raid, Stealth Raider accommodates a variety of playstyles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/83a0d58ef3b49a575a4fe94df25fec25.poster.avif?t=1730468210\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/83a0d58ef3b49a575a4fe94df25fec25.webm?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/83a0d58ef3b49a575a4fe94df25fec25.mp4?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immersive Storyline: Uncover a gripping narrative that takes you deep into a world of mystery and intrigue. Meet a cast of colorful characters, each with their own stories and secrets.<br><br>High Replay Value: With multiple routes, hidden secrets, and varying difficulty levels, each playthrough offers a new experience and fresh challenges.<br><br>Prepare yourself for an exhilarating journey into the shadows. Will you emerge as the ultimate Stealth Raider?",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>About the Game:</strong><br><br>Dive into the thrilling underworld of covert operations with Stealth Raider, the ultimate stealth-action adventure. As a master thief, your skills in subterfuge, agility, and cunning are your greatest assets. Navigate through intricate mazes, ancient dungeons, and high-security vaults, each filled with treasures to plunder and dangers to avoid.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li></li></ul><strong>Dynamic Stealth Mechanics:</strong> Use shadows, disguises, and your environment to remain undetected. Each level presents unique challenges that require a strategic approach to avoid traps, outsmart guards, and bypass advanced security systems.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/5ff6b4549e9df98ae0d78f95375159c8.poster.avif?t=1730468210\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/5ff6b4549e9df98ae0d78f95375159c8.webm?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/5ff6b4549e9df98ae0d78f95375159c8.mp4?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Diverse Levels: Explore a variety of stunning environments, from medieval castles and abandoned temples to modern high-tech facilities. Each level is meticulously designed with hidden paths, secret rooms, and valuable loot.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/e72aaabc8320dc45646b91a9d6f817f5.poster.avif?t=1730468210\" width=600 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/e72aaabc8320dc45646b91a9d6f817f5.webm?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/e72aaabc8320dc45646b91a9d6f817f5.mp4?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Challenging Puzzles: Engage your brain with complex puzzles that unlock new areas and treasures. Use your wits to solve ancient riddles, deactivate security systems, and open secret passages.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/718f1c98bb864d59327529754179102c.poster.avif?t=1730468210\" width=600 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/718f1c98bb864d59327529754179102c.webm?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/718f1c98bb864d59327529754179102c.mp4?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Upgrade Your Gear: Collect and utilize a range of gadgets and tools to aid your heists. From lockpicks and grappling hooks to advanced cloaking devices, customize your loadout to suit your playstyle.<br><br>Non-linear Gameplay: Choose your path and play your way. Whether you prefer a methodical, quiet approach or a daring, high-risk raid, Stealth Raider accommodates a variety of playstyles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/83a0d58ef3b49a575a4fe94df25fec25.poster.avif?t=1730468210\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/83a0d58ef3b49a575a4fe94df25fec25.webm?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677220/extras/83a0d58ef3b49a575a4fe94df25fec25.mp4?t=1730468210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immersive Storyline: Uncover a gripping narrative that takes you deep into a world of mystery and intrigue. Meet a cast of colorful characters, each with their own stories and secrets.<br><br>High Replay Value: With multiple routes, hidden secrets, and varying difficulty levels, each playthrough offers a new experience and fresh challenges.<br><br>Prepare yourself for an exhilarating journey into the shadows. Will you emerge as the ultimate Stealth Raider?",
